WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:01.214
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.510
<v><b>A:</b></v> You’ll never guess who I saw at the theatre last night.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:05.277
<v><b>B:</b></v> Who?

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:06.584
<v><b>A:</b></v> Harry Kane.

00:00:07.017 --> 00:00:09.377
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>The</b> Harry Kane? The footballer?

00:00:09.437 --> 00:00:12.681
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, he was sitting in the row behind me. I couldn’t believe my eyes.

00:00:14.548 --> 00:00:15.312
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.091 --> 00:00:19.188
<v><b>A:</b></v> What do we need to add first, the sugar or the flour?

00:00:19.648 --> 00:00:26.220
<v><b>B:</b></v> Er…hold on a minute while I check. You add <b>the</b>…<b>the</b>…the sugar.